## 2. Customer Information

Collect the information required to fulfil the order.

At minimum include:

* Full name
* Email address
* Phone number
* Delivery/address information if required by the business flow

Validate required fields before allowing payment to begin.

Show clear validation errors.

Do not collect unnecessary sensitive information.

